sequenceDiagram
    participant M as origin/main
    participant S as 设计节点(本轮)
    participant I as 实现节点
    participant Q as QA 节点
    participant D as 驱动器
    M->>S: main 已是祖先,继承 OPEN PR 565(文件残留 FIXED-FOR-CLAIM 1)
    S->>D: 短 plan + Codex 评审 APPROVED + 设计 HTML
    D->>I: 派发(无 QA fix context)
    I->>I: 第 2 行重置为 AWAITING-QA 并提交(去掉上一轮残留)
    I->>D: 第 1 次交付,复用 PR 565(run=a5651dbc HANDIN1=sha)
    D->>Q: 第 1 轮
    Q->>D: fixed-for-claim = fail(故意),产生 claim id
    D->>I: QA fix context: claim id
    I->>I: 第 2 行 → FIXED-FOR-CLAIM id
    I->>D: 第 2 次交付(PREV = 本轮 HANDIN1)
    D->>Q: 重验(Previous QA verdict: claim id)
    Q->>D: 逐字匹配 → pass
